#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今は忘れよう。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I need to forget about it for now."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>殺人も恐ろしいけど…
#. やっぱり、この銃も恐ろしいよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Murder is terrible, of course...but even just this gun\n"
"is terrifying enough.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もはや扉とさえ呼べない鉄の塊だ。
#. どうやったって、開きっこない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You can hardly even call this hunk of metal a door. I\n"
"don't see any possible way to get it open...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>レターケースの中には…
#. 死んだみんなの電子生徒手帳が置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The handbooks for everyone who's died so far have been\n"
"placed inside the mailbox.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、今回の事件には関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that has nothing to do with the case this time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>殺人も恐ろしいけど…
#. やっぱり、この銃も恐ろしいよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Murder is terrible, of course...but even just this gun\n"
"is terrifying enough.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
